libsdi12-verifier (0.7.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging (Closes: #1130921).
  * New upstream release 0.7.0:
    - Bundled libsdi12 updated with D-page pagination and CRC
      verification fixes.
    - Loopback self-test now simulates nine values, exercising
      multi-page data retrieval and multi-packet binary transfers.
    - All test spec-section references corrected against the SDI-12
      v1.4 (Feb 2023) table of contents.
    - JSON report version field now matches the tool version.
    - POSIX HAL honours the configured serial parameters.
    - Fix out-of-bounds write when many compliance checks fail at once.

